OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA warm and sunny start, but
OL,6,Fcloud tending to increase through the
OL,7,Fday making the sunshine hazy. A few
OL,8,Fshowers developing into the afternoon,
OL,9,Fpossibly thundery. Still feeling hot.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FMostly dry overnight with
OL,12,Fvariable cloud and some clear spells,
OL,13,Falthough isolated showers may linger
OL,14,Ftoward the north and east. Still
OL,15,Ffeeling warm for most. Winds remaining
OL,16,Fmainly light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
