OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FVariable cloud and residual
OL,6,Fisolated showers at first but becoming
OL,7,Fdry with sunny spells. Gradually
OL,8,Fturning fresher than recent days with
OL,9,Fa gentle breeze.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FSunday
OL,12,Fand Monday, largely dry with bright or
OL,13,Fsunny spells. Mainly light winds.
OL,14,FCloudier and breezier Tuesday, with
OL,15,Fsome patchy rain or showers.
OL,16,FTemperatures nearer average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
